# Puppeteer timelines
@scenario tutorial_lesson_09
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Watch my feet and my shoulders. One mark on the timeline can change where I stand and how close I look.
[if !tutorial_still]
timeline {
  parallel {
    move "ginger" { x:96 y:-12 dur:640 easing:ease_out }
    scale "ginger" { sx:1.08 sy:1.08 dur:640 easing:ease_out }
  }
}
[endif]
ginger: Open this timeline in Puppeteer. Change the final X position or duration, apply it, and replay.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which target moves this character?
> ginger -> correct
> bg_current -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Use the character ID to animate Ginger. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Use the character ID to animate Ginger.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_09]
[flag tutorial_done_09]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
